      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where this hook is called by the PD task I definitely wanted the delay to be 0, as the PD task could run more than once before the I2CIDLE command can be sent. For deferring again, since it\u0027s in the lowest priority task, i don\u0027t think its necessary to add additional wait time here as it would only get called when there is nothing else to do.",
